     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi all,</div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;d greatly appreciate it if you would consider applying (via direct email to me), or forwarding this to your networks and suggest folks get in touch with me directly. Thanks so much, in advance!</div><div><br></div><div>Ingrid</div><div><br></div><div>**************************<br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(106,168,79);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">OpenStreetMap Annotator at Global Energy Monitor</span></div><div><br></div><div><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(106,168,79);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Pay Type: Hourly</span></h3><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(106,168,79);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Starting Pay: $37.58/hour</span></h3><br><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(106,168,79);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Position Summary:</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">The OpenStreetMap Annotator will work collaboratively with <a href=\"https://globalenergymonitor.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://globalenergymonitor.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464789609000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3QzluuAnfT10EKOm0RkcDv\">Global Energy Monitor</a> and project partners. Through the web-based editing interface of OpenStreetMap (OSM) and other earth engines such as Bing and/or Google Earth, an OSM annotator will contribute to building a geolocated database of solar installations that can then be utilized for further analysis. The annotator will work closely with others supporting GEM&#39;s <a href=\"https://globalenergymonitor.org/projects/global-solar-power-tracker/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://globalenergymonitor.org/projects/global-solar-power-tracker/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464789609000&amp;usg=AOvVaw04lVXV3BfZf79RE8Poks87\">Global Solar Power Tracker</a>.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">This is a part-time, temporary, and remote position. The annotator will be able to work from home but must be based in the United States. This position will last between 3 and 6 months, and the annotator is expected to work at least 20 and no more than 29 hours per week.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Start date</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">: July 3, 2023</span></p><br><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(106,168,79);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Reports To:</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Ingrid Behrsin -- Program Director, Renewables and Other Power</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(106,168,79);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Responsibilities and Duties:</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">The position includes the following areas of responsibility.</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:9pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Geolocate and appropriately label and annotate points and areas of interest in OpenStreetMap based on satellite imagery of solar installations.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Properly tag annotations by checking if such a tag exists or if a new one must be created.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22pt\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Conduct web research and secondary literature analysis to determine and label attribute characteristics associated with solar installations in OSM.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(106,168,79);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Education and Experience:</span></h3><ul style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(26,42,42);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">1-2 years of experience annotating OpenStreetMap satellite imagery.</span></p></li></ul><br><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(106,168,79);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Knowledge/Skills:</span></h3><ul style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Strong research skills, including attention to detail, scrupulous adherence to documented fact.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Resourcefulness in using online search tools, and triangulating online search results and secondary literature.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Basic knowledge of environmental and social impacts of energy production, governmental and business institutional structures, and the global political context of energy.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Demonstrated facility with computers, Global Information Systems (GIS) software, and Google Workplace apps.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Demonstrated ability to master additional technical skills as needed for data development and analysis.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Verdana;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Commitment to social and environmental justice.</span></p></li></ul></div><div><br><span class=\"gmail_signature_prefix\">-- </span><br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmai